# Return to the Depths at Prog 10 (a GM Prog, as the battlefield's win leaves it): Ayame's 881 with a full inventory
# (the Bowyer Ring does not fit: not completed), then with room (completed: Bowyer Ring, Goblin in Disguise, fame +50);
# then the completed lines: Ayame's 882, Tarnotik's 45 (oncePerZone) and the bottle (44: taken, the setPos into the Mine
# Shaft, Prog untouched), Ravorara in Port Bastok with the Pungent Providence Pot (313; option 1: 1000 gil, the pot
# deleted) and without it (314). Ravorara is Out of the Depths' too (completed here: no handler of its own).
lists Metalworks/Ayame/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/881 OldtonMovalpolos/onZoneIn/1 OldtonMovalpolos/Tarnotik/onTrigger OldtonMovalpolos/Tarnotik/onTrade OldtonMovalpolos/onEventFinish/44 PortBastok/Ravorara/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/313
char zone=Metalworks pos=133.9,-19,34.8 lvl=75
fame Bastok 325
quest Bastok.OutOfTheDepths completed
quest Bastok.AQuestionOfFaith completed
quest Bastok.ReturnToTheDepths accepted
charvar Quest[1][78]Prog 10
keyitem PungentProvidencePot
item BottleOfAhrimanTears
item BoneChip
login
trigger Ayame                        # Prog 10: 881
fill-inventory
finish                               # the inventory full: not completed
free-inventory
trigger Ayame                        # 881 again
finish                               # completed
trigger Ayame                        # completed: 882
finish
warp 160.9,12,-54.2 OldtonMovalpolos # completed: no zone-in event
trigger Tarnotik                     # completed: 45 (oncePerZone)
finish
trigger Tarnotik                     # lowered: his script
finish-if-event
trade Tarnotik BoneChip x1           # completed, the wrong item: nil
trade Tarnotik BottleOfAhrimanTears x1  # completed: event 44
finish                               # the bottle taken, setPos into Mine Shaft #2716
tick 400
login                                # the zone change: Mine Shaft #2716
warp -151,-6,-5.7 PortBastok
trigger Ravorara                     # completed, the pot: 313 (0, 0, 0, pot)
finish                               # option 0: nothing, the pot kept
trigger Ravorara                     # 313 again
finish option=1                      # 1000 gil, the pot deleted
trigger Ravorara                     # no pot: 314
finish
